WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.766
Roxy was covered in glowing chemicals.

2
00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:18.789
"I have to wash these chemicals off!" thought Roxy.

3
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.850
"They're making me itchy—and angry!"

4
00:00:22.851 --> 00:00:26.032
She remembered the fire trucks back at the train crash.

5
00:00:26.032 --> 00:00:30.260
"The firefighters can spray me with the hose," thought Roxy.

6
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.652
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

7
00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:39.679
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!" Blue Baboon was still walking toward Metro City.

8
00:00:39.679 --> 00:00:44.551
"I need to move fast!" Roxy said to herself.

9
00:00:44.551 --> 00:00:49.147
She flew through the air, but the chemicals got in her eyes.

10
00:00:49.147 --> 00:00:52.838
She almost crashed into some power lines.

11
00:00:52.839 --> 00:00:55.645
Then she almost plowed into a train car.

12
00:00:55.645 --> 00:00:58.940
Finally she landed near Detective Smith.

13
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.117
"Help!" Roxy cried.

14
00:01:01.118 --> 00:01:03.373
"These chemicals are awful!

15
00:01:03.373 --> 00:01:06.139
They're really, really itchy!"

16
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.569
"Oh no!" said the detective.

17
00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:10.527
"How can I help?"

18
00:01:10.527 --> 00:01:15.477
"Tell the firefighters to blast me with the hose!" said Roxy.

19
00:01:15.477 --> 00:01:22.774
"Right!" said the detective.

20
00:01:22.774 --> 00:01:27.828
The firefighters aimed the hose at Roxy, and water gushed out.

21
00:01:27.829 --> 00:01:30.899
A moment later all the chemicals were gone.

22
00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:35.635
"Whew!" Roxy sighed. "That's better."

23
00:01:35.635 --> 00:01:38.111
Then she realized something.

24
00:01:38.111 --> 00:01:41.815
"I know why Blue Baboon is so angry!

25
00:01:41.815 --> 00:01:45.865
He's itchy from all the chemicals!"

26
00:01:45.865 --> 00:01:49.313
Roxy picked up the fire truck.

27
00:01:49.313 --> 00:01:53.491
"I need to borrow this," she told the firefighters.

28
00:01:53.491 --> 00:01:57.634
She flew after Blue Baboon.

29
00:01:57.634 --> 00:02:02.223
By now he had reached the city. "Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

30
00:02:02.223 --> 00:02:04.903
People ran and screamed.

31
00:02:04.903 --> 00:02:08.240
"It's a big baboon!"

32
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.162
"Run for your lives!"

33
00:02:11.162 --> 00:02:14.595
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

34
00:02:14.595 --> 00:02:20.007
Splash! Roxy dumped the fire truck's water on Blue Baboon.

35
00:02:20.007 --> 00:02:24.502
All the chemicals washed off.

36
00:02:24.502 --> 00:02:26.816
Blue Baboon stopped glowing.

37
00:02:26.816 --> 00:02:28.629
He stopped stomping.

38
00:02:28.629 --> 00:02:30.760
And he stopped scratching.

39
00:02:30.761 --> 00:02:34.377
The big baboon sat down and closed his eyes.

40
00:02:34.378 --> 00:02:37.071
He looked much happier.

41
00:02:37.071 --> 00:02:39.790
"Yay!" Roxy cried.

42
00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:43.263
"Blue Baboon isn't angry anymore.

43
00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.773
But he's still a giant.

44
00:02:45.773 --> 00:02:48.887
There's no way he can go on the tour now.

45
00:02:48.887 --> 00:02:52.196
And he can't return to the zoo either.

46
00:02:52.196 --> 00:02:56.532
Hmm . . ." Roxy tapped her chin and thought.

47
00:02:56.533 --> 00:03:01.381
A month later Roxy and her friends were watching TV at Jack's house.

48
00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.467
Mara grinned.

49
00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:07.080
"I was sad when we found out Blue Baboon wasn't returning to the zoo.

50
00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.075
But I'm not sad anymore."

51
00:03:10.075 --> 00:03:15.398
"Me neither," said Jack. "This is much better!"

52
00:03:15.398 --> 00:03:18.862
"The movie is starting," said Terrell.

53
00:03:18.862 --> 00:03:27.611
A movie title appeared on the screen: Blue Baboon Saves the World!

54
00:03:27.611 --> 00:03:30.417
"Awesome," said Jack.

55
00:03:30.417 --> 00:03:34.002
"I'm glad Rocket Girl brought Blue Baboon to Hollywood.

56
00:03:34.002 --> 00:03:36.565
Now he's a famous movie star!"

57
00:03:36.565 --> 00:03:40.742
"Rocket Girl sure is amazing," said Roxy.

58
00:03:40.743 --> 00:03:42.858
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

59
00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:48.095
Roxy just smiled, and then reached into the bowl for more popcorn.
